	(text
		"SPS-24G-01  Smart Presence Sensor Switch  -  70 x 56 mm, 2-layer 1.6 mm FR-4, 1 oz, ENIG  (SAMAY ELECTRONICS)\nStandalone (no WiFi / no BLE). Fits a standard Indian 86 x 86 mm modular wall box.\n\n===== HIGH-VOLTAGE (AC) SECTION =====================|===== LOW-VOLTAGE (SELV) SECTION ==========\nL in -> F1 T500mA -> ACL_F -+- MOV1 14D471K           |  HLK-PM01 +5V -> ATtiny13A-SU\n                            +- CX1 100nF X2 + RB1 1M  |      PB4 <- LD2410B OUT (24 GHz radar)\n                            +- NTC1 5D-9 -> HLK-PM01 AC/L  |  PB3 <- 10k delay trimmer (10 s..10 min)\n                            +- BTA16-600B MT1          |      PB2 <- override button, PB1 -> status LED\nLAMP out <- BTA16 MT2 ; gate <- RG1 180R <- MOC3063   |      PB0 -> MOC3063 LED (opto, SELV side)\nsnubber RS1 100R + CS1 10nF across MT1-MT2            |  ISP: 6-pin AVR header (program with mains OFF)\n\nIsolation: HLK-PM01 (reinforced AC-DC) + MOC3063 (7.5 kVrms opto) are the ONLY parts crossing the barrier.\n>= 6 mm creepage / >= 3 mm clearance + a routed isolation slot separate the two sections. SEE SAFETY_REVIEW.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 150 0)
